<title>SPAIN: Spain 10-year bond spread hits new low at 63 bps.</title>
<headline>Spain 10-year bond spread hits new low at 63 bps.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The 10-year spread of Spanish bonos over Bunds hit a new record low on Wednesday at 63 basis points, dealers said.</p>
<p>The previous record low was set at 64 bps on May 21.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
